{"seq":3,"slug":"complex-emotion-human-handoff","title":"复杂/高风险/情绪工单转人工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-customer-service-autonomous-ops/ai-intent-routing/complex-emotion-human-handoff","wordCount":2851,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"复杂-高风险-情绪工单转人工\">复杂/高风险/情绪工单转人工</h1><p>分流链路的最后一个环节，也是整个 AI 客服系统里最难被正确度量的一环：<strong>什么时候必须放弃自动化，把会话交给人工</strong>。这个判定之所以难，是因为它同时被两种相反的激励拉扯。自动化指标（解决率、成本）推着你把阈值调低、多接一点；风险与体验指标推着你在不确定时早点转人工。而&quot;转人工率&quot;本身既可以解释成系统谦虚（好），也可以解释成系统无能（坏）——同一个数字，两种叙事。</p>\n<p>判定转人工的正确姿势不是设一个置信度阈值然后祈祷，而是<strong>把触发条件拆成几类互不相同的信号，各自有独立的理由与阈值</strong>。这些信号在语义上不等价：情绪升级是体验信号，政策敏感度是合规信号，额度超限是授权信号，模型置信度是能力信号。把它们压成一个分数会同时丢失可解释性与可调性——当你想调低转人工率时，你不知道你实际放松的是哪一类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>转人工的判定分散在链路的三个不同时刻，越早短路越省成本，这也是本篇与 <a href=\"multilingual-intent-language-detect\">多语言意图识别与语种检测</a> 那篇的判定表衔接的地方。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[消息进入] --&gt; B{事前&lt;br/&gt;消息层信号}&#10;  B --&gt;|威胁·法律主张·自伤| H[立即转人工&lt;br/&gt;最高优先级]&#10;  B --&gt;|语种低置信| H&#10;  B --&gt;|未命中| C[意图+检索]&#10;  C --&gt; D{事中&lt;br/&gt;能力与授权信号}&#10;  D --&gt;|意图 unknown| H&#10;  D --&gt;|事实缺口 gaps 非空| H&#10;  D --&gt;|动作超授权额度| AP[走审批&lt;br/&gt;非直接转人工]&#10;  D --&gt;|未命中| E[生成应答]&#10;  E --&gt; F{事后&lt;br/&gt;情绪与体验信号}&#10;  F --&gt;|情绪升级/重复追问| H&#10;  F --&gt;|未命中| G[保持 AI 通道&lt;br/&gt;进入观察窗]\">graph TD\n  A[消息进入] --&gt; B{事前&lt;br/&gt;消息层信号}\n  B --&gt;|威胁·法律主张·自伤| H[立即转人工&lt;br/&gt;最高优先级]\n  B --&gt;|语种低置信| H\n  B --&gt;|未命中| C[意图+检索]\n  C --&gt; D{事中&lt;br/&gt;能力与授权信号}\n  D --&gt;|意图 unknown| H\n  D --&gt;|事实缺口 gaps 非空| H\n  D --&gt;|动作超授权额度| AP[走审批&lt;br/&gt;非直接转人工]\n  D --&gt;|未命中| E[生成应答]\n  E --&gt; F{事后&lt;br/&gt;情绪与体验信号}\n  F --&gt;|情绪升级/重复追问| H\n  F --&gt;|未命中| G[保持 AI 通道&lt;br/&gt;进入观察窗]</pre><p>三个时刻的划分有实际意义：<strong>事前</strong>信号不需要任何模型调用（省钱且快），<strong>事中</strong>信号有明确的结构化依据（授权模型、检索缺口），<strong>事后</strong>信号需要跨轮次的状态（情绪轨迹、追问计数）。把它们混在一个&quot;综合置信度&quot;里，会失去这种分层的成本优势。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号类别</th>\n<th>判定依据</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>典型动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>安全/法律</td>\n<td>关键词 + 分类器</td>\n<td>原始消息</td>\n<td>立即转人工，最高优先级队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言</td>\n<td>检测置信度</td>\n<td>语种检测器</td>\n<td>转人工（避免错误检索）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能力</td>\n<td>意图 unknown / 生成自评低</td>\n<td>意图分类 + 生成器</td>\n<td>转人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事实</td>\n<td>上下文合同 <code>gaps</code> 非空</td>\n<td>检索裁决层</td>\n<td>转人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权</td>\n<td>动作超出 <code>allowed_actions</code></td>\n<td>授权模型</td>\n<td>走审批流（不是转人工）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体验</td>\n<td>情绪升级、重复追问、负面反馈</td>\n<td>会话状态</td>\n<td>转人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载</td>\n<td>人工队列水位</td>\n<td>排班/队列系统</td>\n<td>动态调整阈值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行值得单独强调：<strong>转人工阈值应该随人工队列的实时水位浮动</strong>。人工坐席全部占满时，机械地按固定阈值转人工只会让买家排队更久；此时系统应更倾向&quot;先给一个诚实的不确定回复 + 承诺跟进&quot;，而不是制造一个永远不接通的排队。这是 AI 分流与排班协同的接口，详见 <a href=\"../ai-cs-ops/ai-human-24h-coverage-staffing\">AI+人工 24h 时区覆盖与排班</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"情绪升级的检测与代价\">情绪升级的检测与代价</h2><h3 id=\"为什么情绪信号是-轨迹-而非-快照\">为什么情绪信号是&quot;轨迹&quot;而非&quot;快照&quot;</h3><p>单轮情绪分类在客服场景价值有限：买家第一句话通常是中性的（&quot;我想问一下我的订单&quot;），真正预示升级的是<strong>跨轮次的走向</strong>——第一轮中性、第二轮开始出现&quot;你们到底有没有人&quot;、第三轮出现全大写或重复标点。用单轮快照做触发，要么过于敏感（把一次正常的强调当成愤怒）要么过于迟钝（等到爆发才反应）。</p>\n<p>一篇针对会话情绪识别的系统级研究比较了三种部署形态：低成本的堆叠集成（句向量 + 窗口化对话上下文 + RandomForest/XGBoost/逻辑回归栈）、纯 LLM 提示（zero-shot / few-shot / chain-of-thought），以及置信度门控的混合方案。报告的数据点很有参考价值：集成模型在 IEMOCAP 上达到 0.595 加权 F1，而 LLM 配置为 0.460–0.536，且集成延迟在 10 毫秒以下、成本显著更低；混合方案把集成最不自信的样本升级给 LLM，在三个数据集上分别为 0.620 / 0.643 / 0.824 加权 F1，Pareto 优于两个纯方案，成本约每百万句 10–85 美元，而纯 LLM 流水线为 99–170 美元（参见 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.17977\">When to Call an LLM: A Confidence-Gated Hybrid for Cost-Effective Emotion Recognition in Conversational AI</a>）。</p>\n<p>该工作还有一个对工程直接有用的观察：<strong>被升级到 LLM 的轮次倾向于出现在情绪或情感发生转变之后</strong>。也就是说，&quot;模型不自信&quot;这个信号本身与&quot;情绪正在变化&quot;高度相关，这让置信度门控不仅是成本优化，还天然是一个敏感的升级探针。这一点值得写进系统设计：把情绪模型的低置信轮次同时上报到转人工判定，而不只是用于路由 LLM。</p>\n<h3 id=\"情绪信号的组合判定\">情绪信号的组合判定</h3><p>单一情绪分数容易误判，实用的触发规则是组合条件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;session_id&quot;: &quot;s_9f21&quot;,&#10;  &quot;turn&quot;: 4,&#10;  &quot;signals&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;neg_sentiment_streak&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;all_caps_ratio&quot;: 0.42,&#10;    &quot;repeat_question_count&quot;: 1,&#10;    &quot;explicit_human_request&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;unresolved_minutes&quot;: 18&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;escalation_rule&quot;: &quot;neg_streak&gt;=2 &amp;&amp; (all_caps_ratio&gt;0.3 || repeat_question_count&gt;=1)&quot;,&#10;  &quot;decision&quot;: &quot;ESCALATE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reason_code&quot;: &quot;sentiment_escalation&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"session_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"s_9f21\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"turn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"signals\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"neg_sentiment_streak\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"all_caps_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"repeat_question_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"explicit_human_request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"unresolved_minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"escalation_rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"neg_streak>=2 &#x26;&#x26; (all_caps_ratio>0.3 || repeat_question_count>=1)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ESCALATE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reason_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sentiment_escalation\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>reason_code</code> 字段是必须的：它让每一次转人工都可归因、可统计、可审计。没有它，你只能看到&quot;转人工率上升了 3 个点&quot;，无法知道是情绪规则过敏感还是知识缺口变多。这个字段也是 <a href=\"../hallucination-compliance/conversation-qa-compliance-review\">会话质检与多市场话术合规</a> 与 <a href=\"../ai-autoresolve/self-service-deflection-rate\">自动化解决率与转人工时机</a> 的共享输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用队列论描述转人工时机\">用队列论描述转人工时机</h2><h3 id=\"erlang-模型的适用与局限\">Erlang 模型的适用与局限</h3><p>&quot;转人工率控制在 15%&quot;这类目标的问题在于它把系统当成静态的：它不告诉你 15% 的转人工量配上当前坐席数会带来多长的等待。真正决定体验的是<strong>到达率与坐席容量的关系</strong>。客服排班领域的经典工具是 Erlang-C 与 Erlang-A 模型：给定到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、平均处理时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>μ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3262em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与坐席数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，可以算出买家需要等待的概率与平均等待时间。</p>\n<p>多服务器极限理论给出了一个对工程很有用的结论：在&quot;服务质量与效率驱动&quot;（QED）区间，最优坐席数近似遵循<strong>平方根安全排班规则</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msqrt><mi>R</mi></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mi>μ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\approx R + \\beta\\sqrt{R}, \\quad R = \\frac{\\lambda}{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.17em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9755em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0645em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是 offered load（以 Erlang 计的负载），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 由目标服务水平决定。这个规则的意义在于：坐席需求随负载<strong>亚线性</strong>增长——负载翻倍，额外的安全边际只按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增长。对跨境场景的实际含义是，当你把 AI 分流率提高、把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 降下来时，所需的坐席减少量小于线性直觉；反过来，一次促销导致 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 激增时，需要的额外坐席也小于直觉。这个结论的严格性质在 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.13845\">Some Asymptotic Properties of the Erlang-C Formula in Many-Server Limiting Regimes</a> 中有讨论，该工作明确指出其研究对象是 QED 区间下平方根安全排班规则的扩展。</p>\n<p>局限同样要说清楚：Erlang 模型假设到达近似泊松、处理时长指数分布、单一技能组、耐心无限。跨境客服三条都不完全成立——到达有强时区周期性（非平稳）、买家等待会放弃（有耐心限制）、坐席有多技能分组。因此模型应作为<strong>容量规划的起点而非精确预测</strong>，实际排班要叠加时区分段与放弃率修正。这些修正的完整做法见排班那一篇。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ai-分流率如何进入容量模型\">AI 分流率如何进入容量模型</h3><p>AI 的存在改变了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 本身：到达人工队列的流量是原始流量扣除 AI 独立解决的部分。工程上要做的是<strong>分时段的 AI 解决率</strong>，而不是全天平均值——夜里 AI 承接比例高（人工少、买家也更可能接受机器人），白天低。用全天平均值估夜间坐席会系统性高估需求。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时段（以某市场当地时）</th>\n<th>原始到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>AI 独立解决率</th>\n<th>人工到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>建议坐席 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>09:00–12:00</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（复杂问题集中在白天）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12:00–18:00</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>18:00–24:00</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>00:00–09:00</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（简单问题为主 + 无人兜底）</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>最少（值班）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的最后一行是本篇与排班那篇的核心接口：夜间 AI 解决率高<strong>不是因为它更强，而是因为夜间的简单问题占比高</strong>。一旦夜间出现复杂问题，AI 挡不住而人工又最薄，这正是自动升级规则必须最严格的时段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"转人工的实现契约\">转人工的实现契约</h2><p>转人工不是一个&quot;发送消息给人工&quot;的动作，而是一次<strong>带完整上下文的会话交接</strong>。交接的质量决定了人工坐席需要多少时间重新理解情况，也直接决定了买家的体验（是否需要重复陈述）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;handoff_id&quot;: &quot;h_5512&quot;,&#10;  &quot;session_id&quot;: &quot;s_9f21&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reason_code&quot;: &quot;sentiment_escalation&quot;,&#10;  &quot;priority&quot;: &quot;HIGH&quot;,&#10;  &quot;queue&quot;: &quot;de_returns_specialist&quot;,&#10;  &quot;context&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;effective_lang&quot;: &quot;de&quot;,&#10;    &quot;intent_history&quot;: [&quot;order_status&quot;, &quot;refund_request&quot;],&#10;    &quot;focus_order_id&quot;: &quot;DE-4410-2207&quot;,&#10;    &quot;facts_used&quot;: [&quot;f1&quot;, &quot;f2&quot;],&#10;    &quot;gaps&quot;: [{ &quot;asked&quot;: &quot;customs_delay_reason&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;no_policy_source_for_market_DE&quot; }],&#10;    &quot;ai_attempted&quot;: [{ &quot;action&quot;: &quot;answer&quot;, &quot;outcome&quot;: &quot;declined&quot;, &quot;why&quot;: &quot;gap_on_customs_policy&quot; }],&#10;    &quot;sentiment_trajectory&quot;: [&quot;neutral&quot;, &quot;negative&quot;, &quot;negative&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;sla_deadline&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28T02:41:07Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"handoff_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"h_5512\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"session_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"s_9f21\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reason_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sentiment_escalation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HIGH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"queue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de_returns_specialist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"context\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"effective_lang\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"intent_history\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refund_request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"focus_order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE-4410-2207\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"facts_used\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"f1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"f2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"gaps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"asked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"customs_delay_reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no_policy_source_for_market_DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"ai_attempted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"answer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"declined\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"why\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gap_on_customs_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sentiment_trajectory\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"neutral\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"negative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"negative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sla_deadline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T02:41:07Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份契约里有三个字段容易被忽略但价值很高。<code>intent_history</code> 让坐席看到买家完整的问题演进，而不是最后一句；<code>ai_attempted</code> 让坐席知道 AI 试过什么、为什么没成，避免人工重复 AI 已经做过的无效尝试（这是买家最反感的一种体验）；<code>priority</code> 与 <code>queue</code> 的分离让路由策略（去哪个技能组）与优先级策略（多快被接）可以独立调整。</p>\n<h3 id=\"避免-转人工黑洞\">避免&quot;转人工黑洞&quot;</h3><p>转人工最常见的工程缺陷是<strong>交接后状态丢失</strong>：买家被转到人工队列，但 AI 侧的会话状态没有被冻结，AI 可能继续自动回复，或者在人工接通后 AI 还在处理同一个会话，导致买家收到两条互相矛盾的回复。</p>\n<p>正确的做法是把会话状态机做成显式的三段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"AI_ACTIVE ──escalate──▶ QUEUED ──agent_accept──▶ HUMAN_ACTIVE&#10;    ▲                       │                        │&#10;    └────── auto_resume ────┘（超时未接 + 可安全）&#10;    ▲                                                │&#10;    └──────────── handback（人工释放且买家同意）────────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>AI_ACTIVE ──escalate──▶ QUEUED ──agent_accept──▶ HUMAN_ACTIVE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ▲                       │                        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └────── auto_resume ────┘（超时未接 + 可安全）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ▲                                                │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └──────────── handback（人工释放且买家同意）────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个关键约束：进入 <code>QUEUED</code> 后 AI 必须停止自动回复（否则矛盾回复），且 <code>QUEUED → AI_ACTIVE</code> 的自动回退只在&quot;排队超时且判定为可安全自动处理&quot;时才允许，并要向买家明确说明状态变化。人工释放后能否 <code>handback</code> 给 AI，取决于买家是否同意——在情绪升级场景下（<code>reason_code = sentiment_escalation</code>）通常不应自动交回 AI，把买家从人工转回机器人是二次伤害。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>转人工判定按信号类别拆分（安全/法律、语言、能力、事实、授权、体验、负载），不要压成一个综合分数；每类有独立的理由与可调阈值。</li>\n<li>判定分布在事前、事中、事后三个时刻：事前不消耗模型调用，事中依据结构化信号（授权、缺口），事后依据跨轮次轨迹。</li>\n<li>情绪信号必须建模为跨轮次轨迹而非单轮快照；情绪模型的低置信轮次与情绪转变高度相关，应同时上报转人工判定。</li>\n<li>用 Erlang 类模型描述容量需求，记住平方根安全排班规则下坐席需求随负载亚线性增长；同时明确其泊松/指数/无限耐心假设在跨境非平稳流量下不成立，只作规划起点。</li>\n<li>每次转人工都要带 <code>reason_code</code>、<code>ai_attempted</code>、<code>intent_history</code>，并把会话状态机做成显式的 AI_ACTIVE / QUEUED / HUMAN_ACTIVE，避免交接后 AI 仍在回复造成的矛盾体验。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>到这里第一章结束：系统能听懂（语种与意图）、能取料（三路检索）、知道何时该放手（转人工）。接下来的第二章 <a href=\"../ai-autoresolve/ai-execute-refund-return-change\">AI 执行退款/换货/改址/催发</a> 处理另一半——那些<strong>不该放手</strong>的会话里，AI 到底能替买家做到哪一步。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"复杂/高风险/情绪工单转人工","id":"复杂-高风险-情绪工单转人工"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"情绪升级的检测与代价","id":"情绪升级的检测与代价"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么情绪信号是\"轨迹\"而非\"快照\"","id":"为什么情绪信号是-轨迹-而非-快照"},{"level":3,"text":"情绪信号的组合判定","id":"情绪信号的组合判定"},{"level":2,"text":"用队列论描述转人工时机","id":"用队列论描述转人工时机"},{"level":3,"text":"Erlang 模型的适用与局限","id":"erlang-模型的适用与局限"},{"level":3,"text":"AI 分流率如何进入容量模型","id":"ai-分流率如何进入容量模型"},{"level":2,"text":"转人工的实现契约","id":"转人工的实现契约"},{"level":3,"text":"避免\"转人工黑洞\"","id":"避免-转人工黑洞"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"订单/商品/政策知识 RAG 检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-customer-service-autonomous-ops/ai-intent-routing/rag-order-product-policy-knowledge"},"next":{"title":"AI 执行退款/换货/改址/催发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-customer-service-autonomous-ops/ai-autoresolve/ai-execute-refund-return-change"}}